; Pullban — an original Sokopelago expert corpus by William Coldren (2026).
; Purpose-built for the Phase 5 expert ability tier: a mix of ordinary push levels
; (which host the shuffled "Pull" item) and levels that REQUIRE the Pull ability —
; a box pinned against a wall you cannot get behind to push, but can pull free.
; The offline solver (tools/solve_corpus.py --corpus pullban) proves which is which.
; Freely distributable with attribution, same terms as the bundled Microban set.

